<title>USA: TENNIS-WOMEN'S RANKINGS AFTER YEAR-ENDING CHASE CHAMPIONSHIPS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-WOMEN'S RANKINGS AFTER YEAR-ENDING CHASE CHAMPIONSHIPS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>WTA rankings after the</p>
<p>year-ending Chase Championships won by Steffi Graf on Sunday:</p>
<p>1. Steffi Graf (Germany)</p>
<p>2 equal Monica Seles (U.S.)</p>
