<p>6. Anke Huber (Germany)</p>
<p>7. Iva Majoli (Croatia)</p>
<p>8. Kimiko Date (Japan)</p>
<p>9. Lindsay Davenport (U.S.)</p>
<p>10. Barbara Paulus (Austria)</p>
<p>11. Irina Spirlea (Romania)</p>
<p>12. Chanda Rubin (U.S.)</p>
<p>13. Brenda Schultz-McCarthy (Netherlands)</p>
<p>14. Mary Joe Fernandez (U.S.)</p>
<p>15. Julie Halard-Decugis (France)</p>
<p>16. Karina Habsudova (Slovakia)</p>
<p>17. Amanda Coetzer (South Africa)</p>
